---

<section class="a2-section a2-section--alt gs-section" id="spectrum">
  <div class="gs-wrap">
    <!-- Chapter header -->
    <div class="gs-header">
      <div class="gs-header__title">
        <h2 class="gs-h2">
          Three patterns. <span class="gs-accent">Different trust and layout boundaries.</span>
        </h2>
      </div>
      <p class="gs-sub">
        Generative UI is not one mechanism—it spans a continuum between rigid predictability and
        open-ended rendering freedom. A2UI occupies the middle ground: agents compose novel layouts
        at runtime, while your client renders only components from a catalog you control.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Differentiated architectural schematic (3-paradigm boundary diagram) -->
    <div class="gs-diagram" role="region" aria-label="Architectural comparison across the three generative UI paradigms">
      <div class="gs-axis" aria-hidden="true">
        <span>← HIGHER HOST CONTROL &amp; NATIVE CONSISTENCY</span>
        <span class="gs-axis__line"></span>
        <span>HIGHER RUNTIME VISUAL FREEDOM →</span>
      </div>

      <div class="gs-lanes">
        <!-- 01 · Static Tool-Bound UI -->
        <article class="gs-lane">
          <div class="gs-lane__top">
            <span class="gs-idx">01 · STATIC UI</span>
            <span class="gs-badge">Fixed template</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="gs-h3">Tool-bound widgets</h3>
          <p class="gs-desc">
            The agent calls a tool and fills typed props into one pre-authored component—such as a
            weather card or stock ticker.
          </p>

          <svg class="gs-svg" viewBox="0 0 320 148" aria-hidden="true">
            <text class="gs-lbl" x="14" y="24">AGENT</text>
            <rect class="gs-box" x="14" y="32" width="76" height="32" rx="3" />
            <text class="gs-mono" x="24" y="52">tool(args)</text>

            <line class="gs-wire" x1="90" y1="48" x2="144" y2="48" />
            <path class="gs-wire" d="M140 44l4 4-4 4" />
            <text class="gs-lbl" x="98" y="40">PROPS</text>

            <!-- Host boundary -->
            <rect class="gs-host" x="150" y="20" width="156" height="114" rx="4" />
            <text class="gs-lbl" x="160" y="35">HOST APP · FIXED SLOT</text>
            <rect class="gs-slot" x="162" y="46" width="132" height="74" rx="3" />
            <line class="gs-ink" x1="174" y1="62" x2="236" y2="62" />
            <line class="gs-muted" x1="174" y1="74" x2="268" y2="74" />
            <rect class="gs-muted-fill" x="174" y="90" width="64" height="16" rx="2" />
          </svg>

          <dl class="gs-traits">
            <div>
              <dt>Layout</dt>
              <dd>Hardcoded per tool</dd>
            </div>
            <div>
              <dt>Renderer</dt>
              <dd>Native host widget</dd>
            </div>
            <div>
              <dt>Trade-off</dt>
              <dd>Every new flow needs app code</dd>
            </div>
          </dl>
        </article>

        <!-- 02 · Declarative Catalog UI (A2UI) -->
        <article class="gs-lane gs-lane--a2ui">
          <div class="gs-lane__top">
            <span class="gs-idx gs-idx--hi">02 · DECLARATIVE UI</span>
            <span class="gs-badge gs-badge--hi">A2UI sweet spot</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="gs-h3">Catalog-governed composition</h3>
          <p class="gs-desc">
            The agent composes component trees, two-way data bindings, and validation rules on the
            fly; the client maps them to native widgets.
          </p>

          <svg class="gs-svg" viewBox="0 0 320 148" aria-hidden="true">
            <text class="gs-lbl gs-lbl--hi" x="12" y="24">AGENT + SDK</text>
            <rect class="gs-box gs-box--hi" x="12" y="32" width="82" height="44" rx="3" />
            <text class="gs-mono gs-mono--hi" x="20" y="50">Express/Jev</text>
            <text class="gs-lbl" x="20" y="65">+ @macro</text>

            <line class="gs-wire gs-wire--hi" x1="94" y1="54" x2="146" y2="54" />
            <path class="gs-wire gs-wire--hi" d="M142 50l4 4-4 4" />
            <text class="gs-lbl gs-lbl--hi" x="100" y="45">JSONL</text>

            <!-- Catalog gate -->
            <line class="gs-gate" x1="150" y1="16" x2="150" y2="136" />

            <!-- Native Host App -->
            <rect class="gs-host gs-host--hi" x="156" y="20" width="152" height="114" rx="4" />
            <text class="gs-lbl gs-lbl--hi" x="166" y="35">NATIVE CATALOG TREE</text>
            <rect class="gs-comp" x="166" y="44" width="62" height="36" rx="2" />
            <rect class="gs-comp" x="234" y="44" width="64" height="36" rx="2" />
            <rect class="gs-comp" x="166" y="86" width="132" height="36" rx="2" />
            <line class="gs-ink-hi" x1="174" y1="56" x2="214" y2="56" />
            <line class="gs-ink-hi" x1="242" y1="56" x2="286" y2="56" />
            <rect class="gs-cta-fill" x="174" y="96" width="76" height="16" rx="2" />
          </svg>

          <dl class="gs-traits">
            <div>
              <dt>Layout</dt>
              <dd>Composed dynamically per intent</dd>
            </div>
            <div>
              <dt>Renderer</dt>
              <dd>React, Lit, Angular, Flutter, SwiftUI, Compose</dd>
            </div>
            <div>
              <dt>Security</dt>
              <dd>Data stream only; zero code execution</dd>
            </div>
          </dl>
        </article>

        <!-- 03 · Open-Ended / Sandboxed Code UI -->
        <article class="gs-lane">
          <div class="gs-lane__top">
            <span class="gs-idx">03 · OPEN-ENDED UI</span>
            <span class="gs-badge">Iframe sandbox</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="gs-h3">Sandboxed web views &amp; code</h3>
          <p class="gs-desc">
            The agent or tool server delivers self-contained HTML, CSS, and JavaScript—such as an
            MCP App or generated artifact—inside an isolated iframe.
          </p>

          <svg class="gs-svg" viewBox="0 0 320 148" aria-hidden="true">
            <text class="gs-lbl" x="14" y="24">TOOL / MODEL</text>
            <rect class="gs-box" x="14" y="32" width="78" height="36" rx="3" />
            <text class="gs-mono" x="22" y="54">&lt;html+js&gt;</text>

            <line class="gs-wire" x1="92" y1="50" x2="144" y2="50" />
            <path class="gs-wire" d="M140 46l4 4-4 4" />
            <text class="gs-lbl" x="98" y="42">BUNDLE</text>

            <!-- Host + Iframe boundary -->
            <rect class="gs-host" x="150" y="20" width="156" height="114" rx="4" />
            <text class="gs-lbl" x="160" y="35">HOST APP</text>
            <rect class="gs-sandbox" x="162" y="44" width="132" height="78" rx="3" />
            <text class="gs-lbl gs-lbl--amber" x="170" y="58">&lt;iframe sandbox&gt;</text>
            <path class="gs-canvas" d="M172 106 Q 198 70, 224 94 T 282 74" />
            <circle class="gs-amber-dot" cx="224" cy="94" r="3" />
          </svg>

          <dl class="gs-traits">
            <div>
              <dt>Layout</dt>
              <dd>Unconstrained DOM, Canvas, or WebGL</dd>
            </div>
            <div>
              <dt>Renderer</dt>
              <dd>Isolated browser frame / WebView</dd>
            </div>
            <div>
              <dt>Trade-off</dt>
              <dd>Separate styling, heavier mobile footprint</dd>
            </div>
          </dl>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Technical comparison matrix -->
    <div class="gs-table-wrap">
      <table class="gs-table">
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th scope="col">Dimension</th>
            <th scope="col">01 · Static tool-bound UI</th>
            <th scope="col" class="is-hi">02 · Declarative catalog UI (A2UI)</th>
            <th scope="col">03 · Open-ended / iframe UI</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr>
            <th scope="row">Brand &amp; accessibility</th>
            <td>Inherits host design system</td>
            <td class="is-hi">Inherits host design system &amp; platform a11y</td>
            <td>Must re-style inside each iframe bundle</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <th scope="row">Cross-platform reach</th>
            <td>Per-app implementation</td>
            <td class="is-hi">One payload across Web, Flutter, iOS, &amp; Android</td>
            <td>Web-first; requires WebView wrapper on mobile</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <th scope="row">Streaming latency</th>
            <td>Renders after tool args resolve</td>
            <td class="is-hi">Incremental updates stream as the model thinks</td>
            <td>Waits for bundle load or full code block</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <th scope="row">Ideal workload</th>
            <td>Single-purpose status &amp; confirmation cards</td>
            <td class="is-hi">Adaptive multi-step product workflows &amp; forms</td>
            <td>Custom 3D scenes, maps, CAD, or third-party mini-apps</td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .gs-section {
    position: relative;
    padding: 120px 0 140px;
    background: var(--a2-bg-alt);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--a2-border-strong);
    scroll-margin-top: 72px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    .gs-section {
      padding: 88px 0 96px;
    }
  }

  .gs-wrap {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 36px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .gs-wrap {
      padding: 0 20px;
    }
  }

  .gs-header {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.05fr 0.95fr;
    gap: 64px;
    align-items: end;
    margin-bottom: 52px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .gs-header {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 16px;
      margin-bottom: 36px;
    }
  }

  .gs-h2 {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--a2-font-display);
    font-size: clamp(2.05rem, 3.6vw, 3rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.08;
    letter-spacing: var(--a2-tracking-h2);
    color: var(--a2-text);
  }

  .gs-accent {
    color: var(--a2-heading-accent);
  }

  .gs-sub {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 15.5px;
    line-height: 1.62;
    color: var(--a2-text-secondary);
  }

  /* Continuum axis bar */
  .gs-axis {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 16px;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    font-family: var(--a2-font-mono);
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.09em;
    color: var(--a2-text-muted);
  }

  .gs-axis__line {
    flex: 1;
    height: 1px;
    background: linear-gradient(
      90deg,
      var(--a2-border-strong),
      var(--a2-accent) 50%,
      var(--a2-amber)
    );
  }

  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .gs-axis {
      display: none;
    }
  }

  /* 3-column architectural schematic */
  .gs-lanes {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 18px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 980px) {
    .gs-lanes {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }

  .gs-lane {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 12px;
    padding: 22px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    border: 1px solid var(--a2-border-strong);
    background: var(--a2-bg);
  }

  .gs-lane--a2ui {
    border-color: var(--a2-accent);
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px var(--a2-accent-border), var(--a2-shadow-md);
  }

  .gs-lane__top {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 8px;
  }

  .gs-idx {
    font-family: var(--a2-font-mono);
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: var(--a2-text-muted);
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .gs-idx--hi {
    color: var(--a2-accent-strong);
  }

  .gs-badge {
    font-family: var(--a2-font-mono);
    font-size: 9.5px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    padding: 2px 7px;
    border-radius: 2px;
    border: 1px solid var(--a2-border-strong);
    background: var(--a2-surface-subtle);
    color: var(--a2-text-muted);
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .gs-badge--hi {
    border-color: var(--a2-accent-border);
    background: var(--a2-accent-soft);
    color: var(--a2-accent-strong);
  }

  .gs-h3 {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--a2-font-display);
    font-size: 19px;
    font-weight: 660;
    letter-spacing: var(--a2-tracking-h3);
    color: var(--a2-text);
  }

  .gs-desc {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 13.5px;
    line-height: 1.56;
    color: var(--a2-text-secondary);
  }

  /* Blueprint SVG styling */
  .gs-svg {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    display: block;
    margin: 4px 0;
    border-radius: 3px;
    border: 1px solid var(--a2-border);
    background-color: var(--a2-surface-subtle);
    background-image: radial-gradient(var(--a2-dot-grid) 1px, transparent 1px);
    background-size: 12px 12px;
  }

  .gs-lbl {
    font-family: var(--a2-font-mono);
    font-size: 7.5px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    fill: var(--a2-text-muted);
  }

  .gs-lbl--hi {
    fill: var(--a2-accent-strong);
  }

  .gs-lbl--amber {
    fill: var(--a2-amber);
  }

  .gs-mono {
    font-family: var(--a2-font-mono);
    font-size: 9.5px;
    font-weight: 600;
    fill: var(--a2-text);
  }

  .gs-mono--hi {
    fill: var(--a2-accent-strong);
  }

  .gs-box {
    fill: var(--a2-surface);
    stroke: var(--a2-border-strong);
    stroke-width: 1;
  }

  .gs-box--hi {
    fill: var(--a2-accent-soft);
    stroke: var(--a2-accent);
  }

  .gs-wire {
    fill: none;
    stroke: var(--a2-text-muted);
    stroke-width: 1.2;
    stroke-linecap: round;
    stroke-linejoin: round;
  }

  .gs-wire--hi {
    stroke: var(--a2-accent);
    stroke-width: 1.5;
  }

  .gs-gate {
    stroke: var(--a2-accent);
    stroke-width: 1.2;
    stroke-dasharray: 3 3;
  }

  .gs-host {
    fill: var(--a2-bg);
    stroke: var(--a2-border-strong);
    stroke-width: 1;
  }

  .gs-host--hi {
    stroke: var(--a2-accent-border);
  }

  .gs-slot {
    fill: var(--a2-surface);
    stroke: var(--a2-border-strong);
    stroke-width: 1;
  }

  .gs-comp {
    fill: var(--a2-accent-soft);
    stroke: var(--a2-accent-border);
    stroke-width: 1;
  }

  .gs-sandbox {
    fill: var(--a2-amber-soft);
    stroke: var(--a2-amber-border);
    stroke-width: 1;
    stroke-dasharray: 4 2;
  }

  .gs-ink {
    stroke: var(--a2-text);
    stroke-width: 1.5;
    stroke-linecap: round;
  }

  .gs-ink-hi {
    stroke: var(--a2-accent-strong);
    stroke-width: 1.5;
    stroke-linecap: round;
  }

  .gs-muted {
    stroke: var(--a2-text-muted);
    stroke-width: 1.2;
    stroke-linecap: round;
  }

  .gs-muted-fill {
    fill: var(--a2-border-strong);
  }

  .gs-cta-fill {
    fill: var(--a2-accent);
  }

  .gs-canvas {
    fill: none;
    stroke: var(--a2-amber);
    stroke-width: 1.6;
    stroke-linecap: round;
  }

  .gs-amber-dot {
    fill: var(--a2-amber);
  }

  .gs-traits {
    margin: auto 0 0;
    padding-top: 12px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--a2-border);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 7px;
  }

  .gs-traits > div {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 78px 1fr;
    gap: 10px;
    font-size: 12.5px;
    line-height: 1.45;
  }

  .gs-traits dt {
    font-family: var(--a2-font-mono);
    font-size: 10.5px;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    color: var(--a2-text-muted);
  }

  .gs-traits dd {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--a2-text);
  }

  /* Matrix table */
  .gs-table-wrap {
    margin-top: 28px;
    overflow-x: auto;
    border: 1px solid var(--a2-border-strong);
    border-radius: 4px;
    background: var(--a2-bg);
  }

  .gs-table {
    width: 100%;
    min-width: 680px;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    font-size: 13.5px;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .gs-table th,
  .gs-table td {
    padding: 13px 16px;
    text-align: left;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--a2-border);
    vertical-align: top;
  }

  .gs-table thead th {
    background: var(--a2-surface-subtle);
    font-family: var(--a2-font-mono);
    font-size: 10.5px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.07em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--a2-text-muted);
  }

  .gs-table thead th.is-hi {
    color: var(--a2-accent-strong);
    background: var(--a2-accent-soft);
  }

  .gs-table tbody th {
    font-weight: 650;
    color: var(--a2-text);
    width: 19%;
  }

  .gs-table tbody td {
    color: var(--a2-text-secondary);
  }

  .gs-table tbody td.is-hi {
    color: var(--a2-text);
    font-weight: 500;
    background: var(--a2-accent-soft);
  }

  .gs-table tbody tr:last-child th,
  .gs-table tbody tr:last-child td {
    border-bottom: none;
  }
</style>
